-- s 7(6): the Canada-U.S. agreement.
#ASSERT NOT (`Do I qualify for regular benefits` TRUE TRUE 700 0.05 FALSE `a minor violation` (YearMonthDay 2026 1 4) 0 (YearMonthDay 2026 6 1) TRUE)
