#ASSERT `How many hours of insurable employment do I need to qualify for regular benefits` 0.115 TRUE `a subsequent violation` (YearMonthDay 2025 1 10) 0 (YearMonthDay 2026 6 1) EQUALS 980
-- Outside the 260 weeks: the section 7 figure.
#ASSERT `How many hours of insurable employment do I need to qualify for regular benefits` 0.115 TRUE `a subsequent violation` (YearMonthDay 2021 6 6) 0 (YearMonthDay 2026 6 1) EQUALS 490
-- s 7.1(3): already counted in two earlier qualifying claims.
#ASSERT `How many hours of insurable employment do I need to qualify for regular benefits` 0.115 TRUE `a subsequent violation` (YearMonthDay 2025 1 10) 2 (YearMonthDay 2026 6 1) EQUALS 490
#ASSERT `How many hours of insurable employment do I need if I have no violation` 0.05 EQUALS 700
#ASSERT `How many hours of insurable employment do I need if I have no violation` 0.13 EQUALS 455
#ASSERT `How many hours of insurable employment do I need if I have no violation` 0.1301 EQUALS 420
#ASSERT `May my violation be counted again in this initial claim` 1
#ASSERT NOT (`May my violation be counted again in this initial claim` 2)
-- 260 weeks are 1,820 days: from 2021-06-07 to 2026-05-31.
#ASSERT `Did I accumulate my violation within the 260 weeks before my initial claim` (YearMonthDay 2021 6 7) (YearMonthDay 2026 6 1)
#ASSERT NOT (`Did I accumulate my violation within the 260 weeks before my initial claim` (YearMonthDay 2021 6 6) (YearMonthDay 2026 6 1))
#ASSERT NOT (`Did I accumulate my violation within the 260 weeks before my initial claim` (YearMonthDay 2026 6 1) (YearMonthDay 2026 6 1))
