#ASSERT `Have I accumulated a violation` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `Have I accumulated a violation` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `Have I accumulated a violation` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE
-- A notice with none of the three circumstances.
#ASSERT NOT (`Have I accumulated a violation` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
-- No notice of violation issued.
#ASSERT NOT (`Have I accumulated a violation` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
-- s 7.1(5)(b): notice issued 2026-01-01; 260 weeks are 1,820 days, back to 2021-01-07.
#ASSERT `Was my notice of violation issued within 260 weeks after I accumulated another violation` (YearMonthDay 2026 1 1) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2025 12 31) FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 1 4)
#ASSERT `Was my notice of violation issued within 260 weeks after I accumulated another violation` (YearMonthDay 2026 1 1) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2021 1 7) FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 1 4)
#ASSERT NOT (`Was my notice of violation issued within 260 weeks after I accumulated another violation` (YearMonthDay 2026 1 1) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2021 1 6) FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 1 4))
-- On the same day is not "after".
