-- No other violation.
#ASSERT NOT (`Was my notice of violation issued within 260 weeks after I accumulated another violation` (YearMonthDay 2026 1 1) FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 1 4) FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 1 4))
-- Any one of the other violations is enough.
