-- Not covered: s 7.1(5) gives a violation for which a warning was imposed no class.
#ASSERT `What class is my violation` TRUE FALSE 3000 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `What class is my violation` TRUE TRUE 3000 EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 7.1(5)(b) applies whatever the value.
#ASSERT `What class is my violation` FALSE TRUE 100 EQUALS JUST `a subsequent violation`
#ASSERT `What class is my violation` FALSE FALSE 999.99 EQUALS JUST `a minor violation`
#ASSERT `What class is my violation` FALSE FALSE 1000 EQUALS JUST `a serious violation`
#ASSERT `What class is my violation` FALSE FALSE 4999.99 EQUALS JUST `a serious violation`
#ASSERT `What class is my violation` FALSE FALSE 5000 EQUALS JUST `a very serious violation`
-- 1,000 + the lesser of 500 x 20 = 10,000 and 8,000.
#ASSERT `What is the value of my violation` 1000 TRUE FALSE 500 20 8000 EQUALS 9000
#ASSERT `What is the value of my violation` 1000 TRUE FALSE 500 20 12000 EQUALS 11000
#ASSERT `What is the value of my violation` 1000 FALSE TRUE 500 20 12000 EQUALS 11000
-- Neither disqualified nor disentitled, and not about section 7: the overpayment alone.
#ASSERT `What is the value of my violation` 1000 FALSE FALSE 500 20 12000 EQUALS 1000

§ `s 8 -- the qualifying period (src:216-232)`
-- 52 weeks before the Sunday 2026-10-25.
#ASSERT `On what date does my qualifying period begin` (YearMonthDay 2026 10 25) FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 1 4) 0 0 EQUALS YearMonthDay 2025 10 26
#ASSERT `On what date does my qualifying period end` (YearMonthDay 2026 10 25) FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 1 4) 0 0 EQUALS YearMonthDay 2026 10 24
-- Three weeks proved under s 8(2): 55 weeks back.
#ASSERT `On what date does my qualifying period begin` (YearMonthDay 2026 10 25) FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 1 4) 3 0 EQUALS YearMonthDay 2025 10 5
#ASSERT `On what date does my qualifying period begin` (YearMonthDay 2026 10 25) FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 1 4) 2 1 EQUALS YearMonthDay 2025 10 5
-- s 8(7): never more than 104 weeks.
#ASSERT `On what date does my qualifying period begin` (YearMonthDay 2026 10 25) FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 1 4) 60 0 EQUALS YearMonthDay 2024 10 27
#ASSERT `On what date does my qualifying period begin` (YearMonthDay 2026 10 25) FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 1 4) 30 30 EQUALS YearMonthDay 2024 10 27
-- s 8(1)(b) is the shorter; the extension applies only to the 52-week period.
#ASSERT `On what date does my qualifying period begin` (YearMonthDay 2026 10 25) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 1 4) 5 0 EQUALS YearMonthDay 2026 1 4
#ASSERT `On what date does my qualifying period end` (YearMonthDay 2026 10 25) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 1 4) 0 0 EQUALS YearMonthDay 2026 10 24
-- A preceding benefit period more than 52 weeks back leaves paragraph (a).
#ASSERT `On what date does my qualifying period begin` (YearMonthDay 2026 10 25) TRUE (YearMonthDay 2025 10 19) 3 0 EQUALS YearMonthDay 2025 10 5
#ASSERT `Does this week extend my qualifying period` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`Does this week extend my qualifying period` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `Does this week extend my qualifying period` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
-- Found guilty of the offence: confinement does not count.
#ASSERT NOT (`Does this week extend my qualifying period` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `Does this week extend my qualifying period` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
-- A measure referred to in paragraph 59(c) or (d) does not count.
#ASSERT NOT (`Does this week extend my qualifying period` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `Does this week extend my qualifying period` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE
-- s 8(5): a week in which benefits were received does not count.
#ASSERT NOT (`Does this week extend my qualifying period` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE)
-- s 8(4): a week during an extension.
#ASSERT `Does this week extend my qualifying period` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE

